{'id':'POL-X02','question':'Can strategic state demand both advance deployment and impair performance?','case_ids':['POL-C02','POL-C03'],'useful_similarities':'State purchasing/administrative demand and financing arrangements shape practical systems; formal reach need not equal reliable service or household welfare.','important_differences':'Monetary issue creates liabilities/value risks; telegraph is an information network. Centuries, regimes, evidence and outside options differ.','evidence_comparability':'Yuan reconstructed annual issues/prices versus Qing prefectural office/price panel; no comparable adoption or welfare metric.','connections_nonindependence':'Both concern parts of China but no direct institutional transmission is established. Some cited Chinese historical compilations recur within cases, not independent causal replications.','omitted_countercases':'Other Yuan regional payments, nonstrategic Qing lines, networks funded without merchant shareholders, and successful fiscal systems elsewhere.','conclusion_limit':'Supports examining who funds and controls complements; does not prove a state-versus-market ranking or a timeless Chinese capacity trait.'},
{'id':'POL-X03','question':'Did telegraph access stabilize every connected market?','case_ids':['POL-C03'],'useful_similarities':'Within the same historical panel, connected markets share technology and estimated specification.','important_differences':'Preexisting volatility and exposure to local/distant shocks differ; connection timing and market roles differ.','evidence_comparability':'Common rice-price reporting framework; baseline-risk subgrouping and weather weights are model choices.','connections_nonindependence':'K13 and K14 use one Gao–Lei study and underlying panel, not independent replications.','omitted_countercases':'Unreported grains, household consumption prices, remote nonrice provinces, unsuccessful/delayed messages and nonusers.','conclusion_limit':'Risk redistribution is more accurate than uniform stabilization; cannot rank household welfare without net-buyer/seller and income evidence.'},
